  InitializationCommands "V_g = 24; % Input voltage\nf_s = 360 * 10^3; % Switc"
"hing frequency\nT_dead = 100*10^-9; % Dead time\nL_blk = 1 * 10^-5; % Bulk in"
"ductance\nC_sc = 110; % Supercap capacitance\nR_on = 10^-1; % On-state MOSFET"
" resistance\nd = 0.5; % duty cycle\nR_big = 10^5; % Balancing resistance\nR_e"
"sr = 18*10^-3; \nR_sens = 10*10^-3\nL_esl = 1 * 10^-6;\nL_damp = 7.5 * 10^-5;"
"\nC_d = 10^-6;\nN_burst = 10;\n\nTs = 1/f_s;\nnum_cycles = 500000;\t\t% numbe"
"r of switch cycles to simulate\nmax_step_size = 10^-1;\t% maximum time step s"
"ize [s]\nTstop = num_cycles*Ts;\t% stop time of simulation [s]"
